{"id":"ritmo","lemma":"ritmo","pos":"noun","rank":1746,"glosses":["rhythm"],"ipa":"/ˈʁit͡ʃ.mu/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f2/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-ritmo.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-ritmo.wav.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"ritmos"},"examples":[{"text":"Vamos pegar o ritmo.","en":"Let's pick up the pace.","words":[{"g":"let's go"},{"g":"to grab, hold"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Não consigo acompanhar seu ritmo.","en":"I can't keep pace with you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1271297","words":[{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to get, obtain","l":"conseguir"},{"g":"to accompany"},{"g":"his"},null]},{"text":"Nós vamos pegar o ritmo.","en":"Let's pick up the pace.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"let's go"},{"g":"to grab, hold"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"O samba é um ritmo brasileiro, não é?","en":"Samba is a Brazilian rhythm, isn't it?","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"samba"},{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"Brazilian"},null,null],"phrases":[[6,8,"isn't it"]]},{"text":"Nesse ritmo, jamais faremos isso.","en":"We'll never make it at this rate.","words":[null,null,{"g":"never"},{"g":"to create","l":"fazer"},{"g":"that"}]}]}